    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aborogera Egiputa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mu mwaka wa cumi n'ibiri, mu kwezi kwa cumi n'abiri ku munsi wa mbere w'uko kwezi, ijambo ry'Uwiteka rinzaho riti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana w'umuntu, curira Farawo umwami wa Egiputa umuborogo umubwire uti ‘Wagereranijwe nk'umugunzu w'intare w'amahanga, ariko umeze nk'ikiyoka kiri mu nyanja. Watumburutse mu migezi yawe, amazi ukayatobesha ibirenge kandi inzuzi zabo ukazihindura icyondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umva uko Umwami Uwiteka avuga ngo: Nzagutega urushundura rwanjye ndi kumwe n'inteko z'abantu benshi, maze bazagukuruze urwo rushundura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nzagusiga imusozi nkujugunye ku butayu, kandi nzohereza ibisiga byo mu kirere byose bikugweho, n'inyamaswa zo mu isi zose nzazikugabiza zihage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyama zawe nzazisandaza ku misozi, n'ibikombe mbyuzuzemo uburebure bwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihugu wogeragamo mu ruzi rwacyo nzakikuvomeramo amaraso, ndetse nyageze no ku misozi, kandi imigende y'amazi izarangiriramo ibyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
